#!/bin/sh
# MicroOS v1.0 Help System (/usr/local/bin/help)

cat <<'EOF'
================================================
MICROOS v1.0 — COMMAND REFERENCE
Minimal Linux. Maximum control.
================================================

System & Information:
  help              Show this command reference
  clear             Clear the terminal screen
  sysinfo           Display MicroOS system overview & memory usage
  hardware [sub]    Inspect live hardware (cpu, memory, network, storage, usb, pci)
  reboot            Safely sync filesystems and reboot
  poweroff          Safely sync filesystems and power off

Networking & Wi-Fi:
  wifi status       Show active Wi-Fi, Ethernet, default route & DNS
  wifi scan         Scan for nearby wireless networks
  wifi connect <S>  Connect securely to Wi-Fi network <S>
  wifi disconnect   Disconnect from wireless network
  wifi dhcp [if]    Acquire IPv4 lease via DHCP
  wifi static ...   Configure static IP address, gateway & DNS

Storage & Persistence:
  disks [list|info] Inspect SATA, NVMe, USB and virtual disks/partitions
  mount <dev> [dir] Safely mount a partition (default: /mnt/ssd)
  unmount [dir]     Safely sync and unmount a partition (default: /mnt/ssd)

Package Management (Debian-Compatible Persistent Storage):
  apt status        Check Debian glibc persistent userspace status
  apt update        Update Debian package lists
  apt search <q>    Search Debian repositories
  apt install <p>   Install Debian package(s) into persistent storage
  apt remove <p>    Remove Debian package(s)
  apt upgrade       Upgrade installed Debian packages

Micro Arcade (Offline Terminal Games):
  arcade            Launch the Micro Arcade interactive menu
  snake             Play Snake
  tetris            Play Tetris
  pong              Play Pong (2-player)
  mines             Play Minesweeper
  2048              Play 2048
  guess             Play Number Guessing
  tictactoe         Play Tic-Tac-Toe (2P or vs CPU)
  spaceinvaders     Play Space Invaders
EOF
